	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsissem tibi libenter, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, ex <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mercatu <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiano</placeName>; verum ego paulo ante merca<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tum eram <placeName ref="l491">Argentinę</placeName> conditionis scholasticę causa, quam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tamen laborum magnitudine territus repudiavi, quod <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>me iam fecisse poenitet.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Domum reversus neminem reperire <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>potui, qui <placeName ref="l157">Francofordiam</placeName> iret; omnes enim ante <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>biduum erant profecti.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nunc, quando tabellarium <placeName ref="l28">Ba<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sileam</placeName> mittere cogor, has quoque per eum ad <persName ref="p8126">Oporinum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>misi, ut inde ad te pervenirent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod vicem meam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>una cum symmystis doles omnemque operam tuam polliceris, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vehementer mihi gratum fuit magnaque me affecit <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>leticia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Agnovi animum vestrum non solum synceris <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>piisque studiis deditum, sed etiam fraterna pręditum charitate <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>magnasque vobis ago gratias.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Princeps noster sibi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>persuadere non patitur me cum <persName ref="p458">Brentio</persName> aliisque ministris <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>idem sentire de coena domini; obiicitur mihi satyra, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cuius initium est: "Absona proloqueris", in qua manifeste <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>dissentiam a <persName ref="p458">Brentio</persName>, neque ego is sum, qui veritati <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>repugnem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Relicta igitur <placeName ref="l496">Stutgardia</placeName> in parvum me contuli oppidulum tribus a <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l496">Stutgardia</placeName> milliaribus nomine <placeName ref="l1436">Pagnang</placeName>, ubi meo (quod aiunt) <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>succu vivo divinum expectans auxilium.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Est mihi magna <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>librorum sarcina, sunt quoque et alia domestica impedimenta, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quę me longius abire non patiuntur in pręsentia, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nisi venditionem haberem alicubi certam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Huiusmodi <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ambire hactenus in <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinatu</placeName> non potui propter subortum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>hulcus in dextro pede.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cęterum eo persanato videbo, num <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>uspiam mihi locus pateat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Interim si quid vos certi v<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>idetis, dignamini mihi significare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Idem hulcus me te<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nuit quoque, quominus istuc sim profectus, uti ipse <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>invitas; invasit me profecto incommodissimo tempore <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>contumaciterque sanitati et medicamentis repugnat.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Do<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>minus det meliora, quęso, ut nempe valeam ipse meęque <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>familię prospicere possim.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, charissime frater, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>meique memor esto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Datum in <placeName ref="l2326">Pagnang</placeName>, 4. iunii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Saluta symmystas tuos meo nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8124">Thomas Naogeorgus</persName> tuus<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Zürc<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>h.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Der nächste Brief des <persName ref="p8124">Naogeorgus</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> ist vom 4. September 1560 (fehlt in vorliegender Datei HBBW) und wurde ebenfalls von Theobald gedruckt: Druck: Leonhard Theobald, Das Leben und Wirken des Tendenzdramatiker der Reformationszeit Thomas Naogeorgus seit seiner Flucht aus Sachsen, Leipzig 1908, S. 94f - Nach Zürich ZB, Ms S 98, 45; Es ist der Letzte an <persName ref="p495">Bulinger</persName> gerichtete Brief den Theobald veröffentlicht hat.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
